# Regenerated per test run and deliberately not committed: integration fixtures
# link the core/dev workspaces, so their lockfiles carry no resolved versions
# and no integrity hashes -- only the ranges already declared in
# core/package.json and dev/package.json. The root package-lock.json is what
# pins the transitive graph those fixtures resolve against.
tests/**/package-lock.json
coverage/
.env
go.sum
dev/.cache/
